{
  "version": 1,
  "repo": "1903978-prog/10bonds",
  "title": "Standing delegation for routine releases (GREEN / AMBER / RED)",
  "owner": "Livio",
  "notes": [
    "Changing this file changes its SHA-256, which ends the delegation until Livio sets the new hash in the repository variable RELEASE_POLICY_SHA256 and records a new activation row in docs/livio-asks.md (changing authority is RED). A release is judged by the policy on the LIVE commit, never by the one in the change.",
    "Order of classification: a RED pattern wins over everything; then AMBER; then GREEN; a path that matches nothing is RED (fail closed).",
    "GREEN is an explicit allowlist (display-only pages, charts and formatting helpers). Everything else under app/ and lib/ and components/ is RED by default; legal wording, e-mail, auth, plans/pricing/quota, data purges and the health/version route are also listed RED explicitly."
  ],
  "red": [
